No. Software vendors are moving from selling software to selling *licenses
to run software*. This is very, very common in the workstation world, where
your license is usually tied to a particular machine ("node locked") or
network ("floating").

Support is also critically important to many companies -- no license, no
support.

In this case, ANDF only saves you the cost of media -- i.e. virtually
nothing.

