> I will ask an Ada-relevant question, namely would there be any value in
> an Ada-shroud with similar intentions to the C-shroud (thoroughly mask
> and disguise the intention of the source).

You could always replace these N (1 per language) shrouds (which require an
unshrouder and N compilers on the target machines) with one ANDF installer
on each target machine and N producers (1 per language) on one source machine.

